{"seq":3,"slug":"precision-guided-weapons","title":"精确制导技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech/precision-guided-weapons","wordCount":1336,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"精确制导技术\">精确制导技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>精确制导技术是使武器准确命中目标的关键技术体系，它使现代军队能以最小弹药消耗实现最大作战效果。从越南战争第一代激光制导炸弹，到海湾战争精确制导武器的大规模应用，「首发命中」的理念彻底改变了空中打击战术和战争伦理。</p>\n<p>理解精确制导的核心，是看清一条<strong>完整制导链</strong>：中段靠惯性/卫星导航把弹药带到目标附近，末段靠导引头把误差从「几十米」收敛到「几米」。每个环节都有各自的优势与软肋，现代武器靠「复合制导」取长补短。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    INS[&quot;惯性导航 INS&lt;br/&gt;(自主·误差累积)&quot;] --&gt; MID[&quot;中段:INS+GNSS&lt;br/&gt;保证航路精度&quot;]&#10;    GNSS[&quot;卫星导航 GNSS&lt;br/&gt;(全球·易干扰)&quot;] --&gt; MID&#10;    MID --&gt; TERM[&quot;末段:红外/雷达/激光导引头&lt;br/&gt;实现终点精度&quot;]&#10;    TERM --&gt; HIT[&quot;命中(CEP ≈ 几米)&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    INS[\"惯性导航 INS&lt;br/&gt;(自主·误差累积)\"] --&gt; MID[\"中段:INS+GNSS&lt;br/&gt;保证航路精度\"]\n    GNSS[\"卫星导航 GNSS&lt;br/&gt;(全球·易干扰)\"] --&gt; MID\n    MID --&gt; TERM[\"末段:红外/雷达/激光导引头&lt;br/&gt;实现终点精度\"]\n    TERM --&gt; HIT[\"命中(CEP ≈ 几米)\"]</pre><h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"制导技术对比\">制导技术对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>制导方式</th>\n<th>自主性</th>\n<th>典型精度（CEP）</th>\n<th>主要软肋</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>惯性导航 INS</td>\n<td>完全自主</td>\n<td>约 1 海里/小时累积</td>\n<td>误差随时间累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卫星导航 GNSS</td>\n<td>依赖卫星</td>\n<td>优于 1 m（M码）</td>\n<td>信号弱、易干扰/欺骗</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>激光半主动</td>\n<td>需外部照射</td>\n<td>优于 3 m</td>\n<td>受云雾烟尘影响、照射方暴露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图像匹配 DSMAC</td>\n<td>自主</td>\n<td>约 3 m</td>\n<td>需预存基准图、依赖地貌特征</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"惯性导航-自主但会漂移\">惯性导航：自主但会漂移</h3><p>惯性导航系统（INS）不依赖外部信息，通过陀螺仪测角速率、加速度计测加速度推算位置。激光陀螺仪（RLG）利用萨格纳克效应，频率差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 与角速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta f = \\frac{4A}{\\lambda L} \\Omega</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\">Ω</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为光路面积，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 为激光波长，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 为光路总长。光纤陀螺（FOG）导航级零偏稳定性可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.0001</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.0001°/h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0001°/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。INS 的固有缺陷是误差随时间积累（导航级约每小时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 海里），因此长时间飞行需与其他导航源组合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"卫星导航-全球但脆弱\">卫星导航：全球但脆弱</h3><p>军用 GPS（M 码）定位精度优于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>。JDAM 通过在普通炸弹上加装 GPS/INS 套件，使命中精度从数十米提高到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span>（CEP）以内。但卫星信号功率极低（到达地面约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>160</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>dBW</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-160\\,\\text{dBW}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dBW</span></span></span></span></span></span>），容易被干扰和欺骗——这就是「导航战」（NavWar，详见 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites\">军事卫星系统</a>）的战场。军用接收机采用抗干扰天线（CRPA）和 M 码处理，可将抗干扰能力提高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>60</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\text{–}60\\,\\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">–</span></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"末制导-把误差收敛到几米\">末制导：把误差收敛到几米</h3><p>激光制导利用照射器照射目标，导引头接收反射激光，通过比例导引律产生控制指令：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>γ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>N</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{\\gamma}_c = N \\dot{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>γ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{\\gamma}_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8623em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为指令过载，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 为导引系数（通常取 3–5），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>σ</mi><mo>˙</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dot{\\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1389em;\"><span class=\"mord\">˙</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为视线角速率。GBU-12「铺路 II」激光制导炸弹应用最广，但需外部激光照射（受云层、烟尘、雨雾影响）。合成孔径雷达（SAR）图像匹配则全天候，AGM-84H SLAM-ER 可在末段进行自动目标识别（ATR），实现对移动目标的锁定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"复合制导-取长补短\">复合制导：取长补短</h3><p>现代精确制导武器普遍组合多种体制：中段 INS/GPS 保证航路精度，末段切换红外成像、毫米波雷达或激光导引头实现精确打击。中国「东风-21D」反舰弹道导弹据推测采用中段惯性/星光修正、再入段切换 SAR+红外双模导引头，实现对海上移动目标的精确打击。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2024–2026 年前沿趋势：基于深度学习的自动目标识别（ATR）使制导武器具备复杂背景自主搜索能力（AI 原理详见 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons\">AI与自主武器</a>）；协同制导使弹群能自组网、共享态势并自主分配目标；量子惯性导航（冷原子干涉仪）有望将惯导精度提高两个数量级，降低对卫星导航的依赖；抗 GPS 干扰和欺骗技术持续升级，视觉导航和地磁匹配被整合作为备份。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在 GPS 信号被大面积压制的高威胁环境中，精确制导武器如何保持命中精度？未来是否可能出现完全不依赖卫星信号的高精度制导方案？</li>\n<li>精确制导如何改变了战争中的附带损伤和平民保护问题？「外科手术式打击」是否真的如宣传般精确？</li>\n<li>随着 AI 应用于目标识别和制导决策，武器系统自主性提高带来了哪些伦理和法律问题？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章姊妹篇：<a href=\"electronic-warfare\">电子战技术</a>、<a href=\"cyber-warfare\">网络战技术</a>。</li>\n<li>卫星导航的攻防（导航战）见 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites\">军事卫星系统</a>；反舰弹道导弹的末制导关联 <a href=\"../aerospace-military-tech/ballistic-missiles\">弹道导弹</a> 与 <a href=\"../weapon-systems/naval-weapon-systems\">海战武器装备</a>。</li>\n<li>ATR 与自主决策的伦理边界见 <a href=\"../emerging-military-tech/ai-autonomous-weapons\">AI与自主武器</a>。</li>\n<li>本 hub 整体定位见 <a href=\"../\">军事技术学科简介</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>精确制导技术使现代武器实现了从「面杀伤」到「点打击」的跨越。惯性导航提供自主性，卫星导航提供全球精度，末端导引头提供终点精度——三者组合构成完整的精确打击技术链。随着 AI 和量子传感的发展，精确制导正朝更高自主性、更强抗干扰和更优打击效果演进。把握「中段+末段」这条制导链主线，再回看 <a href=\"electronic-warfare\">电子战</a> 对制导信号的干扰，便能理解信息战「打击」与「对抗」两端的完整闭环。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"精确制导技术","id":"精确制导技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"制导技术对比","id":"制导技术对比"},{"level":3,"text":"惯性导航：自主但会漂移","id":"惯性导航-自主但会漂移"},{"level":3,"text":"卫星导航：全球但脆弱","id":"卫星导航-全球但脆弱"},{"level":3,"text":"末制导：把误差收敛到几米","id":"末制导-把误差收敛到几米"},{"level":3,"text":"复合制导：取长补短","id":"复合制导-取长补短"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"网络战技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/information-warfare-tech/cyber-warfare"},"next":{"title":"军事卫星系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/military-science/military-technology/aerospace-military-tech/military-satellites"}}